{"id":"n15936-1-10","stage":2,"title":"검토 · 研究","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15936-1-10-1","ko":"필요한 서류를 가져왔습니다.","zh":"我把需要的文件带过来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"필요한","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"필요한","audio":"/audio/801d19a8a024b12dd6e4.mp3"}},{"text":"서류를","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서류를","audio":"/audio/082c16a43156cad95eda.mp3"}},{"text":"가져왔습니다.","meaning":"带来","explanation":"가져오다：带来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"가져오다","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53818","senseId":"2","lemma":"가져오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져왔습니다","audio":"/audio/2901307976e00a2022a9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"13f6f1041daf74b5","term":"가져오다","zh":"带来","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3","entryId":"53818","definition":"拿来某个东西。","pronunciation":["가저오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6acf0a8c847531a7ebb0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15936-1-10-2","ko":"네, 검토 후에 이상이 있으면 연락드리겠습니다.","zh":"好的，审核之后如果有问题会再联系您的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"검토","meaning":"研究，考虑","explanation":"검토：研究，考虑。","readings":[{"term":"검토","audio":"/audio/7e0e212667f735a4ed33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15936","senseId":"1","lemma":"검토","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검토","audio":"/audio/7e0e212667f735a4ed33.mp3"}},{"text":"후에","meaning":"后，以后，事后，过后，随后","explanation":"후：后，以后，事后，过后，随后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"2","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후에","audio":"/audio/6c3ac70f274ffaeff5ba.mp3"}},{"text":"이상이","meaning":"异常","explanation":"이상：异常；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71998","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상이","audio":"/audio/d295791c13585c612475.mp3"}},{"text":"있으면","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으면","audio":"/audio/909011195908a586359d.mp3"}},{"text":"연락드리겠습니다.","meaning":"联络，联系；向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；드리다：向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락드리겠습니다","audio":"/audio/af0539a2b5112b265599.mp3"}